&lt;h2&gt;3) Wiring Table&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="3-wiring-table"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#3-wiring-table" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Component&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Signal&lt;/th&gt;
