&lt;a href="#support" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;For OTA-related issues:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open issue: &lt;a
