&lt;li&gt;Discussions: &lt;a
href="https://github.com/smart-swimmingpool/smart-swimmingpool.github.io/discussions"target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://github.com/smart-swimmingpool/smart-swimmingpool.github.io/discussions&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
