&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note&lt;/strong&gt;: OTA is implemented using the ESP32 Arduino Update library integrated
into the WebPortal. GitHub release builds are handled by the CI pipeline
(&lt;code&gt;release.yml&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>